# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Maternity Ward Backend — Production environment example
# Ko'chirish: cp .env.prod.example .env.prod && nano .env.prod
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Database
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your_strong_password_here

# JWT
JWT_SECRET=your_super_secret_jwt_key_min_32_chars

# Telegram Bot (ixtiyoriy)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token

# App
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3001
TIMEZONE=Asia/Tashkent

# Uploads
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads

# Throttle (so'rovlar chegarasi)
LATE_GRACE_PERIOD_MIN=15
WEEKLY_LATE_PENALTY_THRESHOLD_MIN=120
